@Epocha.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5196

### Browse everything (first page)
GET {{Epocha.Api_HostAddress}}/api/artworks/search
Accept: application/json

### Full-text search
GET {{Epocha.Api_HostAddress}}/api/artworks/search?q=landscape
Accept: application/json

### Filter by era and medium (repeat a parameter to select several values)
GET {{Epocha.Api_HostAddress}}/api/artworks/search?era=Baroque&era=Modern&medium=Painting
Accept: application/json

### Start-year range, sorted by date, second page
GET {{Epocha.Api_HostAddress}}/api/artworks/search?yearFrom=1850&yearTo=1900&sort=DateAsc&page=2&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json
